---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="School Uniforms — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="GWE NGO India provides school uniforms to children whose parents cannot afford them."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>School Uniforms</h1>
        <p>So children can go to school without fear and keep themselves clean and healthy.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <img class="page-image" src="/images/school-uniforms.webp" alt="School uniforms distributed by GWE NGO India" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          We all know that every school has its own uniform, parents with low family income somehow
          send their children to schools but due to lack of money cannot but them a school uniform
          due to which either the children have to get a scolding in school or if they manage to buy
          one dress, they have to wear it the whole week leading to infections due to dirtiness.
        </p>
        <p>
          GWE NGO India therefore provides children with the school uniform so that they can go
          school without any fear of scolding and can keep themselves and their uniforms clean. You
          too can do your bit by providing them the needful.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/donate">Donate Uniforms</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
